          "eyebrow": "Careers at Hudson County Motors",
          "heading": "Real work. Strong team. Long-term opportunity.",
          "body": "Hudson County Motors is a family-owned, full-service heavy-duty truck dealership serving the Tri-state for decades. We’re built on hard work, reliability, and a team that takes pride in what they do.\n\nWhether you’re in the shop, parts, service, or operations, this is a place where your work matters and your growth is supported.",
          "ctaLabel": "See Current Openings",
          "ctaUrl": "https://www.indeed.com/cmp/Hudson-County-Motors",
